  "worked_solution": "The set $B\u2216A$ is the set of all elements belonging to $B$ but *not* $A.$ Note that no elements of $A$ are also in $B.$  Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B\u2216A & =B-A \\\\  & ={2,4,6,8,10}-{1,3,5,7,9} \\\\  & ={2,4,6,8,10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
